﻿

﻿

If Minkowski then worldline+timesheet primacy, if WL+TS then hyperhelices (HH), if WL-TS interaction, then timesheet distortion == near exact GR mirror and if quark braid = strong force then *all* braid dynamics ≈ strong-like, and if HH and only HH then property ≈ H(s)H, if H(s)H then worldline time sheet footprint ≈ ST strings, so… QCD, GR, ST *fall directly out of Minkowski*. I cannot emphasize enough how significant that is. That is my entire reason for continuing to develop SAT. That kind of unification happening so naturally seems astonishingly unlikely on the priors. So, we turned to cosmology, and we tried a bunch of different things, none of it was satisfying… Until we got to the ER bridge. So now we have GR, QCD, (some portion of the swampland of) ST, and asking what is QED showed it can’t be braid force although we tried variations on braid force… so returned our attention to QFT … which gave us holonomy (and that I directly attribute to ChatGPT, I wouldn’t have come up with it myself I don’t think), so now we’ve got GR+QCD+ST(ish)+QFT … return our attention back to QED… That gives us vortices, and that’s the full stack. So then the question is what cosmology is allowable within this picture. Again, nothing seemed to be quite enough… Until we got to ER bridges. That seems to pull it all together so if everything before wasn’t disconcertingly reasonable enough… This last piece seems like the keystone of the whole architecture. We didn’t have to ask why dark energy… It literally fell out of space time…As a black hole mass falling towards the Big Bang already present in the geometry.

﻿

No “Z3 fusion gate” necessary—that’s just “What would rope do?” Rope would not weave itself into four strand structures. No lattice necessary—that’s just an artificial crutch to make the math easier. Absolutely everything comes from the initial assumption.

﻿

Gravity is emergent from multiple components, one of which is back pull. The other is the Einstein mechanism, which is directly related to the electromagnetic mechanism, just severely damped by chirality cancellation and geometric spacing/tension differences.

﻿

And all of this… Without necessitating a single equation. At least not for understanding. Conceptually, all you need is the geometry. We need the equations to prove it. But you don’t need the equations to do the logic. Isn’t that something? And the block is *not* static. And bosons are traveling oscillations without persistent coil, which is what defines mass. 

﻿

Also: sigma T is how that’s pronounced. 

